217 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 154 0 R/E(We are truly delighted to welcome you and your child to Selong Bay School. Our school is committed to creating a warm, safe, and inspiring learning environment where children feel supported to explore, discover, and grow at their own pace.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

218 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 154 0 R/E(At Selong Bay School, we believe that every child learns differently and thrives best in an environment that feels comfortable, personal, and connected, much like a home learning experience. Our approach combines meaningful academic learning with creativity, curiosity, outdoor exploration, and social-emotional development.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

219 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 154 0 R/E(We aim to nurture confident, independent, and compassionate learners by providing child focused experiences that encourage imagination, critical thinking, and a genuine love of learning. Our teachers work closely with families to build a strong partnership that supports each child\220s unique journey and individual potential.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

220 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 154 0 R/E(This Parent Handbook has been prepared to help you better understand our school routines, values, policies, and expectations. We encourage you to read it carefully, as it contains important information that will help us work together to create a positive experience for your child.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

221 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 154 0 R/E(Please feel free to contact us at any time if you have questions. We are excited to begin this wonderful learning journey together with you and your family.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
