253 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 156 0 R/E(      Selong Bay School began with families who came to South Lombok for a season and stayed for the community. Today the school operates under Yayasan Selong Bay Intercultural Sekolah, a registered non-profit foundation \204 we are not for profit organisation, we are for the children and the community of South Lombok. Every fee is reinvested into the school's development: scholarships, community programme, and training for local teachers and staff.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

254 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 156 0 R/T(Our Values)/E(Our Values)/Pg 14 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

255 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 156 0 R/E(       These values shape every classroom, every relationship, and every opportunity to learn. We believe academic excellence is strengthened by strong character, preparing students not only for further education, but to become thoughtful, capable people who make a positive impact wherever they go.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

256 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 156 0 R/Pg 14 0 R/A[1012 0 R 0]/K[11]>>
endobj

257 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 156 0 R/Pg 14 0 R/A[1013 0 R 0]/K[12]>>
