<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 157 0 R/Pg 15 0 R/A[1014 0 R 0]/K[0]>>
endobj

259 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 157 0 R/T(We need a different kind of school)/E(We need a different kind of school)/Pg 15 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

260 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 157 0 R/E(Selong Bay offers a flexible learning experience that combines academic excellence with curiosity, creativity, and real-world learning. Our online curriculum provides structure and rigour, while our beautiful Lombok campus brings learning to life through hands-on, inquiry-based experiences and a strong sense of community.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 157 0 R/E(Families can choose the learning model that suits them best \204 fully online, fully on-campus, or a combination of both \204 and move between options as life changes, without disrupting their child's education or friendships. No matter the mode, students remain part of one cohesive community.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

262 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 157 0 R/E(Our curriculum combines Cambridge International Education, the Australian National Curriculum, and the Selong Bay approach. In the Early Years, learning is play-based, building strong foundations through exploration and discovery. Through Primary and High School, students engage in inquiry-based learning that develops deep understanding alongside essential future-ready skills.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

263 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 157 0 R/Pg 15 0 R/A[1015 0 R 0]/K[5]>>
endobj

264 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 157 0 R/T(Hybrid Model)/E(Hybrid Model)/Pg 15 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

