<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 158 0 R/E(Selong Bay)/Pg 16 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

270 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 158 0 R/T(1. Innovative Eco-Environment)/E(1. Innovative Eco-Environment)/Pg 16 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

271 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 158 0 R/E(     Our campus is not a standard concrete building \204 it is designed as a living, green space, using sustainable architecture, natural light, and eco-friendly technologies directly in its layout. Students don't just read about sustainability; they live it every day. Being in a green environment reduces stress, improves focus, and naturally teaches children to respect the planet.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

272 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 158 0 R/T(2. High-Quality Education \(Nature & Outdoors\))/E(2. High-Quality Education \(Nature & Outdoors\))/Pg 16 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

273 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 158 0 R/E(    Learning moves beyond the traditional four walls of a classroom and into the open air. Lessons in science, maths, and teamwork happen in gardens, outdoor spaces, and on the beach itself, building hands-on problem-solving skills and physical resilience.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

274 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 158 0 R/T(3. Curriculum for a Changing World)/E(3. Curriculum for a Changing World)/Pg 16 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

275 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 158 0 R/E(   Our modern study plan moves away from rote memorisation and focuses on the skills children need today \204 literacy, emotional intelligence, adaptability, and creative problem-solving \204 preparing students to learn and adapt to whatever changes come next.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

276 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 158 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/A[1018 0 R 0]/K[8]>>
