endobj

281 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 159 0 R/E(Education happens anywhere without disrupting progress. With a mobile app and downloadable offline lessons, students can study on flights or in remote areas. Best of all, real-world travel experiences are directly integrated into their daily schoolwork.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

282 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 159 0 R/T(2. Structured Digital Delivery with Real Connection)/E(2. Structured Digital Delivery with Real Connection)/Pg 17 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

283 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 159 0 R/E(Learning is independent but never lost, thanks to clear, step-by-step lesson plans. Students stay socially connected and emotionally supported through weekly live classes, group projects, casual hangouts, and regular wellbeing check-ins.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

284 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 159 0 R/T(3. Full Support for Parents)/E(3. Full Support for Parents)/Pg 17 0 R/K[5]>>
