285 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 159 0 R/E(Parents aren't left to teach alone. The programme provides direct teacher guidance, easy-to-follow plans, and a mobile dashboard app to effortlessly track their child's academic progress while on the road.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

