485 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1103 0 R/E(All students are expected to attend school Monday through Friday, from 8:30 AM to 3:30 PM. Parents are responsible for ensuring their child arrives on time each day. If a child will be absent, parents must notify the school office by 9:00 AM.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

486 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 167 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/A[1104 0 R 0]/K[3]>>
