<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1105 0 R/E(The school day begins at 8:30 AM. Children arriving after 9:00 AM are considered tardy and must be signed in at the school office before being escorted to class.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

489 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1106 0 R/E(Frequent tardiness may lead to a parent meeting to discuss solutions for improving attendance.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[6]>>
