endobj

495 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1109 0 R/E(An absence is considered unexcused if the school is not notified in advance, if the child misses school for a non-emergency, non-medical reason without prior approval, or if absences occur frequently without justification. Patterns of unexcused absence may lead to an attendance review with the family. For short term enrollments, if a student attends late or is absent without 12 hours prior notice, a full payment for that day is expected. )/Pg 25 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

496 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 167 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/A[1110 0 R 0]/K[13]>>
