endobj

500 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1113 0 R/E(We understand that world-schooling and travelling families may have pre-planned trips or obligations. Parents should notify the school at least two weeks in advance if they plan to take their child out of school for an extended period. Tuition remains fully payable during extended absences in order to hold the child's place in the programme and to get access to the online lesson plans and weekly sessions with teachers. )/Pg 26 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

