508 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 169 0 R/E(       Parents must complete a Medical Health Record for their child covering pre-existing conditions, allergies, and medications, so that our teachers can appropriately care for your child during normal school activities and excursions. Any new health problems, changes in condition, medication, or special requirements must be communicated to the school immediately.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

509 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 169 0 R/E(       All teaching staff undergo regular first aid training, and the school maintains first aid supplies on campus. If a student becomes unwell or sustains an injury during the school day, a teacher will provide first aid and assess whether the child can return to class. In the case of a head injury or another serious condition, parents will be contacted immediately. If staff judge that a child is too unwell to remain at school, parents will be called to collect them as soon as possible.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

510 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 169 0 R/Pg 27 0 R/A[1118 0 R 0]/K[7]>>
