<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 171 0 R/T(Parent Permission)/E(Parent Permission)/Pg 29 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

535 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1135 0 R/E(Written parental permission is required as part of enrollment for a child to take part in surf, beach, and swimming activities. Parents may request that their child be excluded from specific water activities at any time by notifying the school in writing.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

