574 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 175 0 R/E(       If a child is absent for more than three consecutive days due to illness, a doctor's note may be requested before they return. Where a contagious illness occurs during term time, the school will notify affected classes so parents can stay alert to symptoms, and will arrange additional deep cleaning of the relevant spaces.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

575 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 175 0 R/T(Updating Medical Information)/E(Updating Medical Information)/Pg 33 0 R/K[3]>>
