583 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 176 0 R/E(Morning tea and snacks are to be provided by parents in lunch boxes brought from home. Please choose healthy, nutritious options, and let your child's teacher know of any allergies within the class. If a student continually brings lollies, candy and other high sugar foods the teachers may request students to keep food in their bag until after school has finished. )/Pg 34 0 R/K[5]>>
