622 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 178 0 R/E(       Child and community safety always remain our top priority. Regular emergency drills are conducted covering the situations most relevant to our location in Lombok, including earthquakes, tsunamis, and severe weather. If a parent or visitor is present during a drill or an actual emergency, it is important to follow staff instructions carefully. In the unlikely event of a natural disaster disrupting communication, please be assured that staff will continue to care for children until they can be safely collected.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[10]>>
